00:08:00.546 --> 00:08:02.248
-Ah! In the Jacuzzi.

00:08:02.248 --> 00:08:03.849
[ Laughter ]

00:08:03.849 --> 00:08:05.585
-Uh-huh.
-Okay.

00:08:05.585 --> 00:08:07.086
One is...

00:08:07.086 --> 00:08:09.088
[ Laughter ]

00:08:09.088 --> 00:08:11.423
I really don't know
who these people are, but...

00:08:11.423 --> 00:08:13.391
