-You should know them.

00:08:13.391 --> 00:08:14.760
-They're -- They're...

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.528
[ Both chuckle ]

00:08:16.528 --> 00:08:18.097
...murderers.

00:08:18.097 --> 00:08:19.364
[ Laughter ]

00:08:19.364 --> 00:08:20.966
They're, like, bad people.
-Oh, oh.

00:08:20.966 --> 00:08:22.201
-This is bad people.
-Okay.

00:08:22.201 --> 00:08:24.369
These are three murderers
in a pumpkin hot tub.

00:08:24.369 --> 00:08:26.705
[ Laughter ]
Now, if this is a lie,

00:08:26.705 --> 00:08:28.340
