a million dollars.

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:29.942
There's no way you can be
making this up.

00:08:29.942 --> 00:08:33.379
-Wait.
-I'm gonna say -- There's more?

00:08:33.379 --> 00:08:35.715
-Smells good.
[ Laughter ]

00:08:35.715 --> 00:08:37.849
-Okay.
I'm going to say...

00:08:37.849 --> 00:08:39.919
Ana de Armas...

00:08:39.919 --> 00:08:42.121
[ Laughter ]

00:08:42.121 --> 00:08:43.956
...you are telling the truth.

00:08:43.956 --> 00:08:45.424
[ Laughter ]

00:08:45.424 --> 00:08:46.591
