00:08:46.591 --> 00:08:47.793
-You sure?

00:08:47.793 --> 00:08:49.028
[ Light laughter ]
-Yes.

00:08:49.028 --> 00:08:51.964
-God damn it.
[ Laughter ]

00:08:51.964 --> 00:08:53.632
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Did I -- Let me see it.

00:08:53.632 --> 00:08:55.033
