00:08:56.936 --> 00:08:59.038
Oh, no, that's -- that's...

00:08:59.038 --> 00:09:00.372
[ Both laugh ]

00:09:00.372 --> 00:09:03.642
Yeah, that's from "Halloween."
That is Jar Jar Binks.

00:09:03.642 --> 00:09:05.310
-This is "Friday the 13th,"
isn't it?

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:06.411
-That's "Friday the 13th."
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:09:06.411 --> 00:09:07.913
-I don't know what that is.
-Yeah.

00:09:07.913 --> 00:09:09.448
I don't know why he's --
he's drinking in a Jacu--

00:09:09.448 --> 00:09:10.649
[ Light laughter ]
-Looks like a shrimp to me.

00:09:10.649 --> 00:09:11.717
-No, that's not a shrimp.

00:09:11.717 --> 00:09:13.118
It's -- It's from
a "Star Wars" movie.

00:09:13.118 --> 00:09:14.620
-Oh.
-A shrimp.

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:15.921
It's Jar Jar -- Oh, yeah.
-I don't know.

00:09:15.921 --> 00:09:17.022
-Good. Alright. Here.
You can put that right here.

00:09:17.022 --> 00:09:18.056
-Okay.
-Alright.

00:09:18.056 --> 00:09:19.425
